# 27. INTERACTION DESIGN

The website should have subtle premium interactions.

Do NOT use animations everywhere.

Use:

### Page transitions

Smooth fade / slide.

### Image reveal

Images reveal progressively as they enter viewport.

### Typography reveal

Headlines animate line-by-line.

### Product hover

Product images slightly zoom.

### Cursor interaction

Optional custom cursor on desktop.

### Horizontal scrolling

Can be used selectively for product collections.

### Parallax

Very subtle.

### Technical data

Numbers and specifications can animate into view.

